+From 5cc616d8ec1cb8c44cc114ea936ab44ecbd44da4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: deCodeUx <t@t>
+Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 16:38:00 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH] fix(evidence): closed versioned ProviderTokenEvidenceV1 with
+ complete mutation matrix
+
+Create packages/orchestration/provider_token_evidence.py as the single
+source of truth for PE schema: PROVIDER_TOKEN_EVIDENCE_SCHEMA_VERSION
+("1.0.0"), closed ALLOWED_FIELDS (~50 fields), SUPPORTED_EXECUTION_MODES,
+required field sets by mode, and validate_provider_token_evidence().
+
+Integrate schema validation into token_truth.py before semantic
+validation. Replace provider_call_count inference fallback with hard
+error. Fix has_actual_counters to check only core actual tokens
+(prompt/completion/total), not supplementary cache metadata.
+
+Update all production PE writers (pingpong_loop, repair_attest,
+manual_attestation, pingpong_evidence) to emit schema_version and
+execution_mode. Update all test fixtures across 4 suites (202 tests)
+with required schema fields.
+
